stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state FileScan {
        [*] --> pending_scan
        pending_scan --> clean : verdict OK (server sha256 recorded at insert)
        pending_scan --> unscanned : SCAN_FAIL_CLOSED=false only (never served)
        clean --> SoftDeleted : DELETE (deletedAt set, bytes retained)
        SoftDeleted --> [*]
    }
    note right of pending_scan
        pending_scan is the column DEFAULT - the verified upload path always writes the
        final verdict, no code writes pending_scan (V1.2 KR-31).
        Infected uploads are REJECTED 422 and never stored (custody protocol ADR-022).
    end note
    state AccountingStage {
        [*] --> with_accountant : start_accounting
        with_accountant --> approved : approve_accounting (3 checks ok)
        note right of approved
            with_head_accountant stage is RETIRED (owner A1) - see 06 Appendix H
        end note
        approved --> posted : post_bill (terminal, duplicate 422, eligibility re-validated ADR-030)
        with_accountant --> with_accountant : return_to_ho (record kept, approver cleared)
        posted --> [*]
    }
    state Milestone {
        [*] --> Mpending
        Mpending --> confirmed : confirm (order R-19, dataManRef for first two)
        confirmed --> Mpending : reverse (latest-only, reason required, status resets to PENDING - source-verified documents.rs 2140, reversedAt/reversalReason record the reversal)
        confirmed --> [*]
    }
    note right of with_accountant
        stage is a SEPARATE vocabulary from package.status
        (with_accountant to with_accounting mapping documented in doc 06 s8)
    end note
